static const char _zs215_d[] = "reserved member name\n\nA type body declares a member named `public` or `tag`, or a unit declares a definition named `public`. `public` names the visibility block, so `public: unit { ... }` is the only declaration it may introduce; `tag` is the arm tag every sum type carries. Rename it.";
